{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34449","headline":"和袭美腊後送内大德从朂游天台 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美腊後送内大德从朂游天台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"应缘南国尽南宗，欲访灵溪路暗通。\n归思不离双阙下，去程犹在四明东。\n铜缾净贮桃花雨，金策闲摇麦穗风。\n若恋吾君先拜疏，爲论台岳未封公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34449.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34449","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}